### Alle Issues eines Projektes abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/issues

### Issue per ID abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1

### Issue erstellen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Demo Issue",
  "description": "Beschreibung des Demo Issues",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "priority": "LOW"
}

### Issue aktualisieren
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Demo Issue aktualisiert",
  "description": "Beschreibung wurde geändert",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Issue löschen
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/issues/1
